      "content": "SP 80 NW           ELLESBOROUGH                THE COOMBE                                                (MISSENDEN ROAD) 2/14 21.6.55                                        Coombe Cottage (formerly                                                listed as Cottage adjoining                                                Golf Club House) GV                                             II House.  Mid C18 .  Vitreous and brown brick with red brick quoins and window surrounds.  Old tile roof, flanking brick chimneys. 2 storeys, 3 bays.  Old metal casements with single horizontal glazing bars and C20 glazing:  3-light flanking 2-light, those to ground floor with chequered segmental heads.  Central C20 door in altered surround with C20 flat wooden hood; blocked door to right of centre. Small single storey extensions to left gable, lean-to to rear. Listing NGR: SP8441506221"
    }
